'''Wither Gourd''' is a [[Spooky Mobs|Spooky Mob]] that spawns only during [[Spooky Festival]]s at night. 

== Spawning ==
'''Wither Gourds''' spawn in the {{Zone|Graveyard}}, {{Zone|Wilderness}}, {{Zone|Spider's Den}} and {{Zone|Obsidian Sanctuary}} at night during [[Spooky Festival]]s. They have a {{Green|4.08%}} chance of being spawned from a [[Trick or Treat Chest]].

== Behavior ==
'''Wither Gourds''' have {{Stat|HP|11}} and deal {{Stat|dmg|50}}. They attack the player with [[Blast o' Lantern]]s, dealing {{Stat|True Dmg}} and {{stat|True knockback}}. Like other [[Spooky Mobs]], it takes only {{Stat|damage|1}} every time it is hit. 

